{"unit_id":"PAKIKNOWLEDGE__dsh-client-ui-skin-claude#feature-1","repo":"PAKIKNOWLEDGE/dsh-client-ui-skin-claude","commit":"a240ab43bd15fd4b2cc853d20bee2c749299134a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Claude Dark 的功能「亮暗配色」：为 DSH Web 重映射背景、边框、文字和强调色 token，并分别定义深色与浅色样式。由皮肤启用后自动呈现，配色随 DSH 原生主题状态变化。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:266-390"]}
{"unit_id":"PAKIKNOWLEDGE__dsh-client-ui-skin-claude#feature-2","repo":"PAKIKNOWLEDGE/dsh-client-ui-skin-claude","commit":"a240ab43bd15fd4b2cc853d20bee2c749299134a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Claude Dark 的功能「字体风格切换」：在设置常规页提供 Anthropic、皮肤衬线和系统默认三种模式。用户从菜单选择后立即更新页面字体，并将非默认选择保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:44-47","lib/client.js:449-497","lib/client.js:560-579"]}
{"unit_id":"PAKIKNOWLEDGE__dsh-client-ui-skin-claude#feature-3","repo":"PAKIKNOWLEDGE/dsh-client-ui-skin-claude","commit":"a240ab43bd15fd4b2cc853d20bee2c749299134a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Claude Dark 的功能「页面细节样式」：为滚动条、文本选区、键盘焦点、徽章和主要按钮应用陶橙及圆角样式。皮肤启用时注入样式表，退出时移除样式和页面标记。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:209-259","lib/client.js:505-531"]}
{"unit_id":"PAKIKNOWLEDGE__dsh-client-ui-skin-claude#feature-4","repo":"PAKIKNOWLEDGE/dsh-client-ui-skin-claude","commit":"a240ab43bd15fd4b2cc853d20bee2c749299134a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Claude Dark 的功能「字号与排版模式」：Anthropic 模式将 Sans 用于界面、Serif 用于对话与 Markdown、Mono 用于代码；皮肤衬线模式提供衬线界面，系统模式保留 DSH 默认字体栈。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:49-124"]}
{"unit_id":"PAKIKNOWLEDGE__dsh-client-ui-skin-claude#caveat-1","repo":"PAKIKNOWLEDGE/dsh-client-ui-skin-claude","commit":"a240ab43bd15fd4b2cc853d20bee2c749299134a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Claude Dark 使用前须知：Anthropic 字体需本机安装；npm 包不附带字体文件。字体选择保存在浏览器 localStorage，存储不可用时不会持久化。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:394-415","lib/client.js:432","README.md:21-29"]}
